    {
      "id": "5.66.3",
      "label": "5.66.3",
      "numbers": [
        3
      ],
      "devanagari": "यथैव धेनुः स्रवति स्नेहात् वत्सस्य वत्सला |\nतथा मम अपि हृदयम् मणि रत्नस्य दर्शनात्",
      "iast": "yathaiva dhenuḥ sravati snehāt vatsasya vatsalā |\ntathā mama api hṛdayam maṇi ratnasya darśanāt",
      "translation": "\"Even as a cow, who is affectionate towards her offspring, gushes forth the milk (from her teats) due to her love at the very sight of her calf, so does my heart too melt through the sight of this excellent jewel.\"",
      "notes": [],
