      "label": "5.66.8",
      "numbers": [
        8
      ],
      "devanagari": "किम् आह सीता वैदेही ब्रूहि सौम्य पुनः पुनः |\nपिपासुम् इव तोयेन सिन्चन्ती वाक्य वारिणा",
      "iast": "kim āha sītā vaidehī brūhi saumya punaḥ punaḥ |\npipāsum iva toyena sincantī vākya vāriṇā",
      "translation": "\"O gentle one! Repeat again and again, what Seetha the daughter of Videha's king said to you, sprinkling me with your stream of words, like offering water to a thirsty person.\"",
      "notes": [],
