    {
      "id": "5.66.10",
      "label": "5.66.10",
      "numbers": [
        10
      ],
      "devanagari": "चिरम् जीवति वैदेही यदि मासम् धरिष्यति |\nक्षणम् सौम्य न जीवेयम् विना ताम् असित ईक्षणाम्",
      "iast": "ciram jīvati vaidehī yadi māsam dhariṣyati |\nkṣaṇam saumya na jīveyam vinā tām asita īkṣaṇām",
      "translation": "\"O gentle one! If Seetha can survive for a month, it means that she is surviving for long. O gentle one! Without that black-eyed Seetha, I cannot survive for even a moment.\"",
      "notes": [],
      "glosses": [
        {
          "itrans": "saumya",
