          "iast": "tām asita īkṣaṇām vinā",
          "devanagari": "तां असित ईक्षणां विना",
          "meaning": "without that Seetha with her dark eyes na jiiveyam = I cannot survive",
          "anvayaIndex": 5,
          "verseIndex": 10
