    {
      "id": "5.66.12",
      "label": "5.66.12",
      "numbers": [
        12
      ],
      "devanagari": "कथम् सा मम सुश्रोणि भीरु भीरुः सती तदा |\nभय आवहानाम् घोराणाम् मध्ये तिष्ठति रक्षसाम्",
      "iast": "katham sā mama suśroṇi bhīru bhīruḥ satī tadā |\nbhaya āvahānām ghorāṇām madhye tiṣṭhati rakṣasām",
      "translation": "\"How does Seetha, my virtuous wife with her charming limbs, who is very shy, stay all the time with demons who are terrific and cruel?\"",
