      "label": "5.66.13",
      "numbers": [
        13
      ],
      "devanagari": "शारदः तिमिर उन्मुखो नूनम् चन्द्र इव अम्बुदैः |\nआवृतम् वदनम् तस्या न विराजति राक्षसैः",
      "iast": "śāradaḥ timira unmukho nūnam candra iva ambudaiḥ |\nāvṛtam vadanam tasyā na virājati rākṣasaiḥ",
      "translation": "\"Her countenance, surely like automnal moon, though liberated of darkness, but screened by clouds, does not shine at present.\"",
